cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Leanamics, please cite it as below."
title: "Leanamics: Lean 4 formalizations of opinion dynamics and related distributed processes"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/formal-dynamics/leanamics"
url: "https://formal-dynamics.github.io/leanamics/"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 + Mathlib formalizations of classical results on opinion dynamics and related
  distributed processes (voter model, Moran process, majority, median and undecided-state
  dynamics, epidemics and rumor spreading, chemical reaction networks, averaging), each paired
  with a blueprint connecting the paper proof to the Lean code statement by statement.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - opinion dynamics
  - distributed computing
  - Markov chains
authors:
  - given-names: Aakash
    family-names: Kumar
  - given-names: Maria Sofia
    family-names: Bucarelli
  - given-names: Niccolò
    family-names: D'Archivio
  - given-names: Emanuele
    family-names: Natale
